{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0233","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:000000f5:text","row":31434,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ん？」","en":"“...Hm?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802232","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00001","en":"Taichi: \"...hm?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:00000119:text","row":31435,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"自宅に戻ると、足下にダンボール箱が置いてある。","en":"When I got home, there was a cardboard box at my feet.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802233","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00002","en":"On return to my home, I found a cardboard box set at my feet.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:0000015f:text","row":31436,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"中身は……食い物だった。","en":"Inside was... food.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802234","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00003","en":"Contents were... food.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The countable contents require a determiner here: 'The contents were food.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":13,"start":0,"text":"Contents were"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:00000197:text","row":31437,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「友貴か」","en":"“Tomoki, huh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802235","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00004","en":"Taichi: \"Tomoki then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:000001b9:text","row":31438,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"本当に一人一人に配送してるんだな。","en":"He really was making deliveries to every last one of us.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802236","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00005","en":"He is really delivering them one by one.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["logical_relation","undertranslation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:000001f3:text","row":31439,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"生真面目なヤツ。","en":"That painfully earnest guy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802237","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00006","en":"That guy's so serious.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:00000223:text","row":31440,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「……出来杉君だな、こりゃ」","en":"“...Our very own Dekisugi. Mr. Perfect.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802238","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00007","en":"Taichi: \"...really giving it all like Dek**ugi-kun, aren't you.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","wordplay","grammar"],"assessment":"The line's Dekisugi reference labels Tomoki an overachieving model child. The English paraphrase 'giving it all' does not preserve that function, adds a question tag, and fails to close the quotation mark.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":63,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"...really giving it all like Dek**ugi-kun, aren't you."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:00000257:text","row":31441,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"それほどまでに本気だということだ。","en":"He was taking it that seriously.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802239","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00008","en":"This is the level of seriousness this reaches,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The Japanese says this shows how serious Tomoki is. The English recursively makes seriousness reach a level and leaves the sentence open with a comma.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":46,"start":0,"text":"This is the level of seriousness this reaches,"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:00000291:text","row":31442,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"本気の逃避。","en":"Escapism pursued in deadly earnest.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802240","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00009","en":"the level of serious escape.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:000002b5:text","row":31443,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴らしいといえば言える。","en":"That was Tomoki all over.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802241","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00010","en":"It's so Tomokish, I must say.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0233:000002e7:text","row":31444,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"リンゴをかじった。ぬるかった。","en":"I bit into an apple. It was warm.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802242","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3006:00011","en":"I bit into an apple. It was lukewarm.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
